WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
The hook tests the front wafer while the turning tool loads the plug.

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.625
The spring compresses. When the hook lowers, the wafer returns with it.

00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:03.333
The middle wafer resists. The hook lifts it clear before moving on.

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:05.667
Watch the middle wafer as the hook lowers and returns to the front.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.458
The first wafer now stays up too.

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:09.333
The hook checks the middle window on its way to the rear wafer.

00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:10.833
All three tips are clear. The rear notch still sits below the copper sidebar tooth.

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:11.458
The hook lifts the rear wafer farther. Its sloping notch lets the tooth move inward.

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:13.583
The bar slides clear of the brass housing.

00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:13.833
The turning tool carries all three wafers and the sidebar around together.
